{"title":"A-Star Winter Math Camp","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A-Star_Winter_Math_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Overview\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>A* Winter Math Camp has programs for 4th - 12th graders in Bay Area. The program consists of 6 days of intensive math classes between December 26th and 31st.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Courses_and_Schedule\">Courses and Schedule</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A-Star_Winter_Math_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Courses and Schedule\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>There are five levels: Pre-Mathcounts, Mathcounts/AMC8, AMC10/12, AIME, and USAMO/USAJMO.\n</p><p>Daily schedule: Math classes run from 9am-5pm.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"More_Information\">More Information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=A-Star_Winter_Math_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: More Information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>You can find more information about the A* Winter/Summer Math Camps here:\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://alphastar.academy/\">https://alphastar.academy/</a>\n</p><p>A* is part of AlphaStar Academy which offers Winter/Summer Math, Physics, CS camps as well as numerous academic courses and programs throughout the year.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017153043\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14387:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017153043 and revision id 89424. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}